{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Drifters Don't Brake",
    "steam_appid": 1391610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.poster.avif?t=1736710553\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.webm?t=1736710553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.mp4?t=1736710553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Drifters Don't Brake</strong> provides a very satisfying <i>drifting </i>experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D.D.B. differs from other games of the genre by not allowing the player to control whether the car is accelerating or not. In D.D.B. your car is always accelerating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only way of reducing the car's speed is by <strong><i>drifting</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game consists of hand-designed stages and challenges. Perfect for speed-runners, the game provides many different ways of completing the same stage. Shortcuts might help you get a lower stage time, but don't think it will be easy to get them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Regular -</strong> Simply beat all the stages to complete this game mode. The game will save the lowest time you took to complete each stage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collectibles -</strong> There will be 3 stars placed in each stage. Completing a stage will award 1-4 stars depending on how many stars were collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explorer -</strong> This is the last game mode. It also contains stars, but adds a new challenge: hidden areas. Those areas will reveal themselves when the car is close enough to the entrance.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.poster.avif?t=1736710553\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.webm?t=1736710553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391610/extras/e92bfc444901791aeb09d7f3fc82cf9d.mp4?t=1736710553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Drifters Don't Brake</strong> provides a very satisfying <i>drifting </i>experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D.D.B. differs from other games of the genre by not allowing the player to control whether the car is accelerating or not. In D.D.B. your car is always accelerating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only way of reducing the car's speed is by <strong><i>drifting</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game consists of hand-designed stages and challenges. Perfect for speed-runners, the game provides many different ways of completing the same stage. Shortcuts might help you get a lower stage time, but don't think it will be easy to get them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Regular -</strong> Simply beat all the stages to complete this game mode. The game will save the lowest time you took to complete each stage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collectibles -</strong> There will be 3 stars placed in each stage. Completing a stage will award 1-4 stars depending on how many stars were collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explorer -</strong> This is the last game mode. It also contains stars, but adds a new challenge: hidden areas. Those areas will reveal themselves when the car is close enough to the entrance.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Drifters Don\u2019t Brake is a top-down racer where your car never stops accelerating, and drifting is your only way to control speed.",
